From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:01 2001
From: Trey Moen <trey@moen.ai>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 15:30:00 -0700
Subject: cam: TEMP wedge-bisection instrumentation v4 (+direct CDM reg read)

Adds a raw CDM register READ between init_hw and config_hw: posted
writes hide a dead (unclocked) block, reads wedge the NoC. If the
"about to READ" line is the last output, CDM's clocks are off at
config time. REMOVE when root-caused.
---

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/msm/camera/camera_kt/drivers/cam_cdm/cam_cdm_hw_core.c b/drivers/media/platform/msm/camera/camera_kt/drivers/cam_cdm/cam_cdm_hw_core.c
index b346b89..9ab239d 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/msm/camera/camera_kt/drivers/cam_cdm/cam_cdm_hw_core.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/msm/camera/camera_kt/drivers/cam_cdm/cam_cdm_hw_core.c
@@ -649,6 +649,7 @@ static bool cam_hw_cdm_bl_write(
 {
 	struct cam_cdm *cdm_core = (struct cam_cdm *)cdm_hw->core_info;
 
+	pr_err("vamos-cdm: bl_write src=0x%x len=%u fifo=%u\n", src, len, fifo_idx);
 	if (cam_cdm_write_hw_reg(cdm_hw,
 		cdm_core->offsets->bl_fifo_reg[fifo_idx]->bl_fifo_base,
 		src)) {
@@ -675,6 +676,7 @@ static bool cam_hw_cdm_commit_bl_write(struct cam_hw_info *cdm_hw, uint32_t fifo
 		CAM_ERR(CAM_CDM, "Failed to write CDM commit BL");
 		return true;
 	}
+	pr_err("vamos-cdm: BL committed, engine fetching (fifo=%u)\n", fifo_idx);
 	return false;
 }
 
diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/msm/camera/camera_kt/drivers/cam_isp/isp_hw_mgr/cam_ife_hw_mgr.c b/drivers/media/platform/msm/camera/camera_kt/drivers/cam_isp/isp_hw_mgr/cam_ife_hw_mgr.c
